Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 08:23:33 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] YouTube phone picker: Categories and Channels headings

The phone channel dropdown mixed "Category: Entertainment" rows in with the
channel names. It now lists All channels, then a Categories heading and a
Channels heading (optgroups, as on the Scoreboard Show picker), without
the prefix. NavigationChoice gains an optional Group that SectionSelect
renders as an optgroup; choices without one are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
